# Which canvas size is used: scenes of the alternative canvas (1280x720) vs main (1920x1080) vs no canvas;
# the video-mix size and the canvas object size are separate fields in the reference (divergence quirk).
source cam 100 100
scene m
scene a alt
scene n none
add m cam i1
add a cam i2
add n cam i3
pos i1 960 540
pos i2 960 540
pos i3 960 540
print i1
print i2
print i3
get i1
get i2
get i3
